#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:5
#: 1a5c16463f964c2e8679759b94aa6bcd
msgid "Tips for Improving QuadPlane Safe Operation"
msgstr "提高四旋翼飞机安全操作的技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:7
#: f3108708b325483b9ae9d0e827058394
msgid ""
"Large commercial QuadPlanes not only represent significant investments, "
"but also can have safety concerns due to their size and speed. Often "
"these vehicles are operated near their operational limits to obtain "
"maximum duration and payload delivery. Here are some tips to prevent "
"accidents, based on reported incidents and subsequent analysis by "
"ArduPilot support engineers."
msgstr ""
"大型商业四旋翼飞机不仅代表着重大投资，而且由于其尺寸和速度也可能存在安全隐患。这些飞行器通常在其操作极限附近运行，以获得最大续航时间和载荷交付能力。以下是一些基于报告事件及"
" ArduPilot 支持工程师后续分析的事故预防建议。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:9
#: 893e3b809e0a4d1e8a3c2551cff84151
msgid "Utilize an autopilot with redundant IMUs and sensors"
msgstr "使用具有冗余 IMU 和传感器的飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:10
#: 7d2bcdcba5ed4647acac73eaa915f303
msgid ""
"Utilize a quality airspeed sensor, compass, and GPS. Redundant sensors "
"are suggested, if possible."
msgstr "使用高质量的空速传感器、罗盘和 GPS。如果可能，建议使用冗余传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:11
#: 15d08b7589c64ba29df6e1f2da380675
msgid ""
"Read and follow the Wiki's :ref:`plane-configuration-landing-page` and "
":ref:`quadplane-setup` instructions. Be sure to setup the "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` and "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` parameters."
msgstr ""
"阅读并遵循 Wiki 的 :ref:`plane-configuration-landing-page` 和 :ref:`quadplane-"
"setup` 说明。确保设置 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:12
#: 1af3553da49a41d094cba4c2c3dc2e63
msgid ""
"Follow the Wiki's :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` instructions "
"before the first hovers. In step 10, using the QuickTune LUA script is "
"preferable to manual TX tuning, or using the AUTOTUNE mode. Be sure to "
":ref:`autocal the airspeed sensor<calibrating-an-airspeed-sensor>` in the"
" first Fixed Wing flight and follow the :ref:`Fixed Wing Tuning<tuning-"
"quickstart>` and subsequent tuning pages' instructions."
msgstr ""
"在首次悬停前遵循 Wiki 的 :ref:`quadplane-vtol-tuning-process` 说明。在第 10 步中，使用 "
"QuickTune LUA 脚本比手动遥控器调参或使用 AUTOTUNE 模式更为推荐。确保在首次固定翼飞行中 :ref:`自动校准空速传感器"
"<calibrating-an-airspeed-sensor>`，并遵循 :ref:`固定翼调参<tuning-quickstart>` "
"和后续调参页面的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:13
#: feff26729c5345be94fd32e120de4682
msgid ""
"After the first VTOL/FW/VTOL flights, use MAVExplorer's MAGFIT utility to"
" refine the :ref:`compass calibration <common-magfit>`."
msgstr ""
"完成首次 VTOL/固定翼/VTOL 飞行后，使用 MAVExplorer 的 MAGFIT 工具精细校准 :ref:`罗盘 <common-"
"magfit>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:16
#: 3cacfa2d0eb942e18bedd7fa60ffe966
msgid "Suggested Parameters (differing from defaults)"
msgstr "建议参数（与默认值不同）"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:18
#: 5868ba94f81b4e4091e99cd1d51d7578
msgid ""
"Although it requires setup per flying location, the use of "
":ref:`DO_LAND_START<common-do-land-start>` missions and "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` is advised, to control approach "
"direction."
msgstr ""
"虽然需要根据飞行地点进行设置，但建议使用 :ref:`DO_LAND_START<common-do-land-start>` 任务和 "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 来控制进近方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:19
#: 67a014af0a144eb882c170a2b71a8c6d
msgid ""
"Be sure to configure the landing sequence with long enough base and final"
" legs so as to assure the turn offshoots are corrected before the final "
"transition to VTOL on landing. A vehicle moving at 30m/s with 30deg "
"maximum bank angle will only turn at 9 deg/sec resulting a >200meter turn"
" radius. Bear in mind that winds can widen the turn radius significantly."
msgstr ""
"确保将降落序列配置为足够长的基础腿和最终进近腿，以确保在最终过渡到 VTOL 降落前修正转弯偏差。以 30m/s 飞行、最大倾斜角为 30 "
"度的飞行器转弯速率仅约 9 度/秒，转弯半径超过 200 米。请记住，风会显著增大转弯半径。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:20
#: 1e034e99eeec4f0bb8e79c39dc6988b6
msgid ""
"Be sure to set the :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` parameter, it "
"should be set to just above :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`, which "
"should be 25% above stall speed, otherwise the normal cruise airspeed "
"will be used on the approach, greatly increasing the radius of turns and "
"their recovery to the mission path."
msgstr ""
"确保设置 :ref:`TECS_LAND_ARSPD<TECS_LAND_ARSPD>` 参数，应设置为略高于 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`，而 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"应为失速速度的 125%，否则在进近过程中将使用正常巡航空速，大幅增加转弯半径及其对任务路径的修正量。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:21
#: 243243341c6e4bcb851dd4e6fe682e41
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Test the above landing sequence in SITL with the -f quadplane frame, "
"using your parameters for TECS, and pitch/roll angle limits, to assure it"
" can execute the landing pattern correctly."
msgstr "在 STIL 中使用 -f quadplane 机架，带入您的 TECS 参数及俯仰/横滚角度限制，测试上述降落序列，以确保能够正确执行降落模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:22
#: e7803ab66c374831b72e70a40cccb872
msgid ""
"Use :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>`, bit 5 = 1 to assure that RC failsafes "
"while in VTOL modes are treated as QRTLs instead of QLANDs, if not "
"operating on a mission with :ref:`DO_LAND_START<common-do-land-start>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 第 5 位 = 1，以确保在 VTOL 模式下发生遥控失控保护时被视为 QRTL "
"而非 QLAND，前提是不在带有 :ref:`DO_LAND_START<common-do-land-start>` 的任务中操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:23
#: 5773560c55524700a101d470a0c08234
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` to be about 3m/s less than "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`, but still above the vehicles stall "
"speed, to avoid undesired assist operation within the normal operating "
"speed envelope."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_ASSIST_SPEED<Q_ASSIST_SPEED>` 设置为比 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 低约 "
"3m/s，但仍高于飞行器的失速速度，以避免在正常操作速度范围内出现不必要的辅助操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:24
#: dced3cc6c8a5497dabcf73c93006ccf2
msgid ""
"Set the transition failure timer :ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL<Q_TRANS_FAIL>` to an "
"appropriate time and set :ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT<Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT>` to "
"QRTL, unless operating at BVLOS distances. In this case, it might be "
"better to set the action to warning only and decide what do as the "
"situation warrants."
msgstr ""
"将过渡失败计时器 :ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL<Q_TRANS_FAIL>` 设置为适当的时间，并将 "
":ref:`Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT<Q_TRANS_FAIL_ACT>` 设置为 "
"QRTL，除非在超视距（BVLOS）距离内操作。在这种情况下，最好将动作设置为仅警告，并根据情况决定处理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-reliability.rst:25
#: fbd3d4b991b44a96b44430a77d5bb94f
msgid ""
"When setting up the Battery Failsafe, use "
":ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 6 for a fixed wing return, "
"loiter down to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`, and QLAND."
msgstr ""
"设置电池失控保护时，使用 :ref:`BATT_FS_LOW_ACT<BATT_FS_LOW_ACT>` = 6 进行固定翼返航，盘旋下降至 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，然后执行 QLAND。"

